 {
  "coord": "16:21",
  "verdict": "FAIL",
  "category": "term",
  "note": "\"forestall'd remission\" (a pardon begged for in advance) rendered as \"grudging\".",
  "replacement": "CHIEF JUSTICE. Sweet Princes, what I did, I did in honor, led by the fair guidance of my conscience. And you will never see me beg for a ragged, pre-arranged pardon. If truth and upright innocence fail me, I'll go to the King my master, who is dead, and tell him who sent me after him."
 },
