  "category": "too-close",
  "note": "The cushion joke (a cushion stuffed under her dress as the pretend baby) is left flat and unexplained.",
  "replacement": "FIRST BEADLE. If it does, you'll have your dozen cushions again. You only have eleven now, because the twelfth is stuffed under your dress as the baby. Come, I order you both to come with me, because the man you and Pistol beat between you is dead."
